<title>JAPAN: JAPAN'S MITSUZUKA TO MEET THAI FIN MINISTER - MOF.</title>
<headline>JAPAN'S MITSUZUKA TO MEET THAI FIN MINISTER - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka will meet Thai Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya at 1:15 p.m. (0415 GMT) on Monday, the Japanese Ministry of Finance (MOF) announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The two ministers are scheduled to give a joint news conference after the meeting, a ministry statement said.</p>
</text>
